    'Applied when someone chooses a password: profile, reset and WooCommerce sign-up. Existing passwords keep working.' => 'Digunakan apabila seseorang memilih kata laluan: profil, tetapan semula dan pendaftaran WooCommerce. Kata laluan sedia ada terus berfungsi.',
